  "solution": {
    "text": "Two given lines intersect, if<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>(</mo><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#10233;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>s</mi><mo>)</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#10233;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#10233;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>s</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math> ...(i)<br /><br /><math><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#10233;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>s</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math> ...(ii)<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>13</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#10233;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>s</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math> ...(iii)<br /><br />On solving Eqs. (i) and (iii), we get<br /><br /><math><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math>Required point is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mover><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>&#729;</mo></mover><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn